    text: "Affected stops:\r\nTejon St & W 32nd Ave (#16709) (eastbound)\r\n16th St & Boulder St (#10273) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Platte St (#22575) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Little Raven St (#23488) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Delgany St (#22577) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Delgany St (#22573) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Little Raven St (#19030) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Platte St (#18315) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Central St (#10254) (westbound)\r\nBoulder St & 15th St (#12396) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 32 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 32nd Ave & Vallejo St (#25477)\r\n15th St & Wynkoop St (#22574)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 32 get on/off buses at:\r\n15th St & Wynkoop St (#22572)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Tejon St (#10917)"
